# Custom traditions: finite reviewed choices, not an unrestricted numerical bonus editor.
# https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/casting-traditions (Ultimate)
Custom Casting Tradition	CATEGORY:Custom Casting Tradition	TYPE:CustomCastingTradition	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SPELL_POOL_LEVELS,1	DEFINE:SPHERES_TRADITION_DRAWBACKS|0	DEFINE:SPHERES_TRADITION_BOONS|0	DEFINE:SPHERES_TRADITION_BOON_ONLY|0	DEFINE:SPHERES_TRADITION_REMAINING|0	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_TRADITION_REMAINING|max(0,SPHERES_TRADITION_DRAWBACKS-max(0,2*SPHERES_TRADITION_BOONS-SPHERES_TRADITION_BOON_ONLY))	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Custom Casting Drawback|5	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_SPELL_POINTS|if(SPHERES_TRADITION_REMAINING>=5,SPHERES_SPELL_POOL_LEVELS,if(SPHERES_TRADITION_REMAINING>=4,1+floor(2*SPHERES_SPELL_POOL_LEVELS/3),if(SPHERES_TRADITION_REMAINING>=3,floor((SPHERES_SPELL_POOL_LEVELS+1)/2),if(SPHERES_TRADITION_REMAINING>=2,1+floor(SPHERES_SPELL_POOL_LEVELS/3),if(SPHERES_TRADITION_REMAINING>=1,1+floor(SPHERES_SPELL_POOL_LEVELS/6),0)))))	DESC:Choose your INT/WIS/CHA casting ability in Spheres Casting Ability. Up to five drawback points; each boon consumes two credits, using boon-only credits first; remaining ordinary points increase spell pool per the Ultimate chart. GM approves the tradition. Drawback restrictions and boon actions are sheet rules, not automatically enforced.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/casting-traditions
Tradition - Verbal Casting	CATEGORY:Custom Casting Drawback	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Tradition,Custom Casting Tradition	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Custom Casting Boon|1	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_TRADITION_DRAWBACKS|1	DESC:Magic requires clear audible speech; silence and inability to speak prevent casting. One drawback point.
Tradition - Somatic Casting	CATEGORY:Custom Casting Drawback	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Tradition,Custom Casting Tradition	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Custom Casting Boon|1	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_TRADITION_DRAWBACKS|1	DESC:Requires gestures and at least one unoccupied hand. Armor heavier than light incurs arcane spell failure. One drawback point; select Somatic Casting Second Selection for the stricter armor restriction. Resolve sphere arcane spell failure at the table.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/casting-traditions
Tradition - Somatic Casting Second Selection	CATEGORY:Custom Casting Drawback	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Tradition,Custom Casting Tradition	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Somatic Casting	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Custom Casting Boon|1	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_TRADITION_DRAWBACKS|1	DESC:Any armor or shield incurs arcane spell failure for sphere casting. Adds one drawback point. Remove this choice before removing the first selection; resolve failure at the table.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/casting-traditions
Tradition - Extended Casting	CATEGORY:Custom Casting Drawback	COST:2	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Tradition,Custom Casting Tradition	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Custom Casting Boon|2	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_TRADITION_DRAWBACKS|2	DESC:Increase sphere casting time one step: swift or immediate to move, move to standard, standard to full-round, full-round to one round, one round to one minute. Counts as two drawbacks. Resolve casting actions at the table.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/casting-traditions
Tradition - Extended Casting Second Selection	CATEGORY:Custom Casting Drawback	COST:2	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Tradition,Custom Casting Tradition	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Extended Casting	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Custom Casting Boon|2	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_TRADITION_DRAWBACKS|2	DESC:Sphere casting takes at least one minute. Adds two drawback points, for four total. Remove this choice before removing the first selection; resolve casting actions at the table.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/casting-traditions
Tradition - Focus Casting	CATEGORY:Custom Casting Drawback	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Tradition,Custom Casting Tradition	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Custom Casting Boon|1	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_TRADITION_DRAWBACKS|1	DESC:Requires a designated focus to cast; record the focus in character notes. One drawback point.
Tradition - Magical Signs	CATEGORY:Custom Casting Drawback	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Tradition,Custom Casting Tradition	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Custom Casting Boon|1	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_TRADITION_DRAWBACKS|1	DESC:Your magic has obvious sensory manifestations. One drawback point.
Tradition - Prepared Caster	CATEGORY:Custom Casting Drawback	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Tradition,Custom Casting Tradition	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Charged Spells	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Custom Casting Boon|1	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_TRADITION_DRAWBACKS|1	DESC:Prepare sphere effects as required by Prepared Caster. One drawback point; track preparations manually. Incompatible with Charged Spells.
Tradition - Easy Focus	CATEGORY:Custom Casting Boon	COST:2	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Tradition,Custom Casting Tradition	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_TRADITION_BOONS|1	DESC:Maintain concentration as a move action; action economy is resolved at the table. Costs two general drawback points.
Tradition - Fortified Casting	CATEGORY:Custom Casting Boon	COST:2	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Tradition,Custom Casting Tradition	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Draining Casting	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_TRADITION_BOONS|1	DESC:Use Constitution as your casting ability modifier if higher than your usual casting ability modifier. Requires Draining Casting; modifier substitution is automatic for the existing INT/WIS/CHA casting choices. Costs two drawback points.
Tradition - Metamagic Expert	CATEGORY:Custom Casting Boon	COST:2	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Tradition,Custom Casting Tradition	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_TRADITION_BOONS|1	DESC:+1 competence bonus to caster level when augmenting sphere abilities with a metamagic feat; situational. Costs two drawback points.
Tradition - Draining Casting	CATEGORY:Custom Casting Drawback	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Tradition,Custom Casting Tradition	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Custom Casting Boon|1	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_TRADITION_DRAWBACKS|1	DESC:Draining Casting drawback; record and adjudicate nonlethal damage according to the source. One drawback point.
Tradition - Addictive Casting	CATEGORY:Custom Casting Drawback	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Tradition,Custom Casting Tradition	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Custom Casting Boon|1	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_TRADITION_DRAWBACKS|1	DESC:Spending spell points requires a Fortitude save against a rising addiction DC; failure inflicts and worsens addiction penalties. Resolve saves and addiction at the table. One drawback point.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/casting-traditions
Tradition - Area Bound	CATEGORY:Custom Casting Drawback	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Tradition,Custom Casting Tradition	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Custom Casting Boon|1	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_TRADITION_DRAWBACKS|1	DESC:Magic is bonded to one notable location; using magic more than MSB miles from it requires a concentration check or the action is wasted. Record the bonded site; an 8-hour ritual moves it. One drawback point.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/casting-traditions
Tradition - Bonded Casting	CATEGORY:Custom Casting Drawback	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Tradition,Custom Casting Tradition	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Custom Casting Boon|1	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_TRADITION_DRAWBACKS|1	DESC:Spell points can only be spent within 30 feet of a living bonded creature with line of sight and effect. Source: Baron’s Glorious Arena. A second selection is not represented here. One drawback point.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/casting-traditions
Tradition - Charged Spells	CATEGORY:Custom Casting Drawback	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Tradition,Custom Casting Tradition	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Prepared Caster	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Custom Casting Boon|2	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_TRADITION_DRAWBACKS|1	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_TRADITION_BOON_ONLY|1	DESC:Sphere effects must be prepared into charges over ten consecutive full-round actions before use. Source: Spheres Apocrypha: Casting Traditions. Track charges manually. Incompatible with Prepared Caster and Diagram Magic. Supplies one ordinary credit and one additional boon-only credit; optional charge conditions are not implemented.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/casting-traditions
Tradition - Mental Focus	CATEGORY:Custom Casting Drawback	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Tradition,Custom Casting Tradition	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Custom Casting Boon|1	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_TRADITION_DRAWBACKS|1	DESC:Casting requires mental focus, lost on failed mind-affecting saves, confirmed critical hits, or lost concentration; refocusing is a full-round action that provokes. Not the practitioner martial focus. One drawback point.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/casting-traditions
Tradition - Terrain Casting	CATEGORY:Custom Casting Drawback	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Tradition,Custom Casting Tradition	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Custom Casting Boon|1	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_TRADITION_DRAWBACKS|1	DESC:Sphere abilities cost one additional spell point or one extra casting-time step, else your space and adjacent squares are blighted into dead magic for you. One drawback point.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/casting-traditions
Tradition - Unsettling Casting	CATEGORY:Custom Casting Drawback	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Tradition,Custom Casting Tradition	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Custom Casting Boon|1	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_TRADITION_DRAWBACKS|1	DESC:Casting inflicts cumulative strain damage per spell point spent. Third-party source [Cata. HB] on the casting traditions page. One drawback point.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/casting-traditions
Tradition - Vampiric Casting	CATEGORY:Custom Casting Drawback	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Tradition,Custom Casting Tradition	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Custom Casting Boon|1	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_TRADITION_DRAWBACKS|1	DESC:After resting, caster level with all spheres drops to 1 until you drain blood from a helpless or willing creature. Third-party source [CrimDan] on the casting traditions page. One drawback point.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/casting-traditions
# https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/martial-traditions (Ultimate custom tradition guidelines)
Custom Martial Tradition	CATEGORY:Conscript Martial Tradition	TYPE:CustomMartialTradition	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_LEVEL,1	ABILITY:Spheres Combat Talent|AUTOMATIC|Equipment Sphere	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Custom Martial Equipment|1	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Custom Martial Sphere|1	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Custom Martial Theme|1	DESC:With GM approval choose two Equipment talents (one from Equipment Sphere's existing free grant and one from Custom Martial Equipment), one non-Equipment base sphere, and one thematic combat talent/base sphere. No choices spend Conscript combat talents. Source exceptions and starting proficiency trades remain manual.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/martial-traditions	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Spheres Martial Focus
